---
title: FlowDux Multiplayer Request Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Player
    participant Client as ClientRemote<br/>Middleware
    participant WS as Ktor WebSocket<br/>Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth<br/>Middleware
    participant Room as Room<br/>Manager
    participant SRM as ServerRemote<br/>Middleware
    participant Store as FlowDux Store<br/>(Middleware Pipeline)
    participant View as StateView<br/>Filter
    participant Tick as Tick Batcher<br/>(60fps)

    Player->>Client: Action 발생 (캐릭터 이동)
    activate Client
    Client->>Client: ServerSharedAction 감지
    Client->>Client: TypedClientConnection.send(action)
    Note right of Client: 내부: ActionCodec.encode()<br/>→ MessageCodec.encodeActionMessage()
    Client->>WS: WSS 전송
    deactivate Client

    activate WS
    WS->>Auth: JWT 검증
    activate Auth
    Auth-->>WS: userId 확인
    deactivate Auth

    WS->>Room: getRoom(userId)
    activate Room
    Room-->>WS: Room A
    deactivate Room

    WS->>SRM: TypedServerConnection.incoming
    activate SRM
    Note right of SRM: 내부: MessageCodec.decodeActionFromClient()<br/>→ ActionCodec.decode()
    SRM->>Store: dispatch(action)

    Note over Store: Middleware Pipeline<br/>1. Validation<br/>2. AuthCheck<br/>3. GameLogic<br/>4. ServerRemoteMiddleware

    Store->>Store: reducer → state 업데이트
    Store->>SRM: serve() → state 변경 감지
    Note right of SRM: ClientSharedAction 인터셉트<br/>→ connection.send(action)
    deactivate SRM

    SRM->>View: 상태 전달
    activate View
    View->>View: 플레이어별 상태 필터링
    View-->>Tick: 필터된 상태
    deactivate View

    activate Tick
    Note over Tick: 16.67ms 간격으로<br/>누적 상태 배치 전송

    Tick->>WS: TypedServerConnection.send()
    deactivate Tick

    WS->>Client: WSS 응답
    deactivate WS
    activate Client
    Client->>Client: TypedClientConnection.incoming
    Note right of Client: 내부: MessageCodec.decodeServerMessage()<br/>→ ActionCodec.decode()
    Client->>Player: 상태 업데이트 (UI 반영)
    deactivate Client
